# Generated by tools/ from framework-metadata.json. The metadata-sync CI guard relies on these being
# byte-identical to a fresh regeneration; pin them to LF so core.autocrlf can't introduce CRLF on a
# Windows checkout and make the git-diff guard misfire. See docs/framework-metadata-ssot.md.
framework-metadata.json text eol=lf
claude-plugins/skills/**/references/*.generated.md text eol=lf

# Committed agent bundle (built by tools/build-agent-bundle.mjs, shipped in the npm package).
# Same reason as above: the CI/pre-commit bundle guard byte-compares a fresh regeneration, so
# pin LF to keep core.autocrlf from misfiring it on a Windows checkout. See docs/agent-guidance-distribution.md.
Angular/projects/spiderly/agent/** text eol=lf
